==Unlocking==
This [[Mount]] ''cannot'' be obtained through [[Items#Crafting|Item Crafting]].

It is unlocked upon completion of all tasks in the [[WHAT - Wizard's Hat Annual Tournament]] event. This also is rewarded at the start of the [[Anniversary]] event for free. It is also available for unlock during other annual events by redeeming with a specific amount of event currency.

Event Mounts alternate between this and {{ItemTooltip|Broomstaff Of Klevdariah}}. This mount may be obtained during the following [[Events|events]]:
* [[WHAT - Wizard's_Hat_Annual_Tournament]]
* [[Solstice]]
* [[Halloween]]
* [[Anniversary]] (Mount automatically awarded to player if not yet unlocked)

